WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.706
Node finally ships

00:00:01.529 --> 00:00:02.873
SQLite built in

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:04.404
On the twenty-sixth

00:00:04.215 --> 00:00:05.477
of November Node

00:00:05.289 --> 00:00:06.456
twenty-seven alpha

00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:06.998
shipped with a

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:07.882
one-line change

00:00:08.001 --> 00:00:09.628
node sqlite mark

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:10.253
as stable

00:00:10.774 --> 00:00:11.965
The module arrived

00:00:11.776 --> 00:00:12.873
in version twenty-two

00:00:12.684 --> 00:00:13.557
point five

00:00:13.675 --> 00:00:14.264
and was a

00:00:14.076 --> 00:00:15.455
release candidate since

00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:16.741
twenty-five point seven

00:00:16.552 --> 00:00:17.814
and twenty-four point

00:00:17.625 --> 00:00:18.344
fifteen

00:00:18.878 --> 00:00:19.797
Watch the number

00:00:19.609 --> 00:00:20.175
trap

00:00:20.234 --> 00:00:21.201
plain numbers go

00:00:21.012 --> 00:00:21.861
in as floats

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:22.899
so store text

00:00:22.711 --> 00:00:23.807
IDs as strings

00:00:23.654 --> 00:00:24.314
and use a

00:00:24.126 --> 00:00:25.057
big integer when

00:00:24.869 --> 00:00:25.670
you need one

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:27.204
Full story on

00:00:27.015 --> 00:00:27.911
the dashboard
